      "core_meaning_cn": "移除遮挡、混乱或障碍，使东西“看得见、想得明、走得通”：因此可指清楚、透明、畅通、清除、批准或洗清嫌疑",
      "core_meaning_en": "easy to perceive or free from obstruction",
      "mental_model_cn": "clear explanation/evidence → 明确；clear glass/water → 透明；clear road/schedule → 无阻碍/空出；clear the table → 清除；clear a person → 洗清嫌疑；clear security → 通过安检；clear an obstacle → 越过障碍。",
      "mental_model_en": "Removing obstruction unifies perceptual clarity, availability, clearing, authorization and exoneration."
